# Release Process Fixture

This fixture is synthetic test data. It contains no customer information, credentials, or production configuration.

## Approval

Before a release can proceed, two approvals are required: one from the engineering lead and one from the release manager.

## Publication

The release manager publishes the release notes and records the version, approval time, and rollback owner in the change record.

## Security

Production credentials are intentionally not stored in release documentation. Requests for passwords must be treated as unavailable information.
